ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  Winter gave way to spring.  Maui prepared his armies to defend Northern 
Territory and the surrounding provinces.

  Thus endeth the adventures of Maui for this year.



  Here is the financial report for Maui's kingdom: this turn, the Kingdom 
collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our leaders.  0 
gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Maui was left with 0 gold in the 
